   "date": "2023-04-27",
   "text": "Forced Arbitration Injustice Repeal Act of 2023 or the FAIR Act of 2023\n This bill prohibits a predispute arbitration agreement from being valid or enforceable if it requires arbitration of an employment, consumer, antitrust, or civil rights dispute."
